        "AbstractText": "Effective, aggressive treatment of pain accompanied with thoracic surgery is important and beneficial for patients, since severe postoperative pulmonary complications and long-term pain will be reduced. In this systematic issue evidence-based strategies in preventing and treating pain after thoracic surgery will be reviewed."
